# Every script here runs on Windows via cmd.exe/PowerShell. LF-only line endings in a .bat file
# caused a real, silent failure on one machine (cmd.exe parsing a multi-line parenthesized block)
# while tolerating it fine on another - confirmed 2026-07-28. Force CRLF for everything so this
# can't quietly reappear regardless of what tool or OS touches a file next.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psd1 text eol=crlf
*.reg text eol=crlf
